    <briefdescription>
<para>Зручні макроси для виклику <ref refid="class_logger_1af831a965a5ea3bc724f5a8facfd4d2d3" kindref="member">Logger::log()</ref> з автоматичним <bold>FILE</bold>/__LINE__. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Обгортка <computeroutput>do { ... } while(false)</computeroutput> дозволяє безпечно використовувати макроси в конструкціях <computeroutput>if/else</computeroutput> без фігурних дужок: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(error)</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group___log_macros_1ga7ebf4c3b4fb05d6f9094089ded75cbdd" kindref="member">LOG_ERROR</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Something<sp/>went<sp/>wrong&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>безпечно</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">else</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="group___log_macros_1gac8e803773221119947b55f6ae85a9c63" kindref="member">LOG_INFO</ref>(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;All<sp/>good&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);<sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>безпечно</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
